{
  "video_id": "216-U0Tu3hk",
  "title": "Claude Code Can Rebuild Any Website You Show It",
  "description": "Comment \"CLONE\" and I'll send you the link\n\nClaude Code can now rebuild any website you show it.\n\nYou paste a link, it opens the real page, reads the layout, and studies how the whole thing is put together. Then it builds you your own working version.\n\nPoint it at a few competitor sites and it pulls things like their live pricing into one clean table.\n\nThis works because Claude can reach the actual internet now, not just the files on your computer.\n\nA week of developer work, done in about twenty minutes, and you own everything it builds.",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-05T15:08:24Z",
  "channel_name": "Brock Mesarich | AI for Non Techies",
  "transcript": "Comment \"CLONE\" and I'll send you the link\n\nClaude Code can now rebuild any website you show it.\n\nYou paste a link, it opens the real page, reads the layout, and studies how the whole thing is put together. Then it builds you your own working version.\n\nPoint it at a few competitor sites and it pulls things like their live pricing into one clean table.\n\nThis works because Claude can reach the actual internet now, not just the files on your computer.\n\nA week of developer work, done in about twenty minutes, and you own everything it builds.",
